# Tests & benchmarks

- `Agents/tests/` unit/integration; `Agents/benchmark/` shared harnesses (`Agents/benchmark/README.md`).
- Run: `uv run --extra dev pytest Agents/tests Agents/benchmark -q` (or a focused path).
- SQL Pro: `Agents/benchmark/sql_pro/`, `uv run python -m benchmark.sql_pro.run`, `.cursor/commands/sql-pro.md`.
- Do not commit `Agents/benchmark/results/` (gitignored).
- Failing test first for bugs; no skip/xfail to green the gate.
